"The :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` API should be used with "
":c:type:`PyConfig` instead."
msgstr ""
"به‌جای آن، باید از API :c:func:`Py_InitializeFromConfig` به همراه "
":c:type:`PyConfig` استفاده شود."

